WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.840
What does it mean to be
a featherless, two-legged,

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.360
linguistically conscious
creature born between urine

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.320
and feces--

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.600
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.360
--whose body will soon
be the culinary delight

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.280
of terrestrial worms?

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.520
That's what philosophy
is all about.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.880
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.520
Every generation of
the human species

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.480
has to come to terms with
how to love? How to live?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.407
How are you going to
deal with a catastrophe?

00:00:28.407 --> 00:00:29.840
How are you going to
preserve your style?

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.560
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.200
This class revolves around
three fundamental questions.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:42.480
One, what does it
mean to be human?

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.400
Terrifying query.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:49.920
Two, what are the forms
of love that constitute

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.640
the best of our humanity--

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.760
love of truth, love of
goodness, love of beauty.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:03.120
Third, how does community,
tradition, heritage

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:11.840
shape and mold our conceptions
of who we are as human beings?

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:12.400
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:16.720
When you listen to music, you
have to be willing to smile

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.520
when you didn't
expect it, or cry

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:22.400
when you had no sense of
where your tears come from.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.880
That's in part what
it means to wrestle

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:27.440
with that terrifying
question of, what

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.280
does it mean to be human? 

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:33.238
And then be willing to get out

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:37.840
of your unique and singular
skin and imagine what it's

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.400
like to be in the
skin of others,

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:46.400
others in every
corner of the globe.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:53.840
I am Cornel West, and
this is MasterClass.

